{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  DTC SHOP BY SUBTYPE SECTION - COLLECTION SUBTYPE NAVIGATION
  =============================================================================
  Collection subtype navigation system for organizing product categories
  - Displays subtype options as clickable image boxes
  - Automatically highlights active subtype based on current collection
  - Links to different collection subtypes for easy navigation
  - Responsive grid layout with image and label display
  - Used for organizing products by style, category, or type
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  CONDITIONAL SECTION DISPLAY
  =============================================================================
  Only displays section when subtype blocks are configured
  - section.blocks.size > 0: Checks if any subtype blocks exist
  - Prevents empty section from displaying
  - Ensures content is available before rendering
{% endcomment %}
{% if section.blocks.size > 0 %}    
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    SUBTYPE NAVIGATION CONTAINER
    =============================================================================
    Main container for subtype navigation grid
    - dtc-shop-by-subtype_container: Primary wrapper for subtype navigation
    - wide-container: Full-width container for responsive layout
    - Contains all subtype navigation boxes
  {% endcomment %}
  <div class="dtc-shop-by-subtype_container wide-container">
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      SUBTYPE BLOCKS ITERATION
      =============================================================================
      Loops through all configured subtype blocks
      - section.blocks: Array of subtype blocks from theme editor
      - block: Individual subtype block with settings
      - Each block represents one subtype navigation option
    {% endcomment %}
    {% for block in section.blocks %}
      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        INDIVIDUAL SUBTYPE BOX
        =============================================================================
        Single subtype navigation box with conditional active state
        - dtc-shop-by-subtype_box: Base styling for subtype box
        - active: CSS class applied when subtype matches current collection
        - block.settings.label contains collection.title: Active state logic
        - Links to subtype-specific collection or page
      {% endcomment %}
      <div class="dtc-shop-by-subtype_box{% if block.settings.label contains collection.title %} active{% endif %}">
        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          SUBTYPE NAVIGATION LINK
          =============================================================================
          Clickable link to subtype destination
          - block.settings.link: Link destination from theme editor
          - Links to collection, product, or external page
        {% endcomment %}
        <a href="{{ block.settings.link }}">
          {% comment %}
            =============================================================================
            SUBTYPE IMAGE
            =============================================================================
            Visual representation of subtype category
            - block.settings.image: Subtype image from theme editor
            - image_url: width: 300: Optimized image with 300px width
            - alt: block.settings.label: Accessibility alt text using subtype label
            - width="150" height="150": Fixed dimensions for consistent layout
          {% endcomment %}
          <img 
              src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 300 }}" 
              alt="{{ block.settings.label }}"
              width="150"
              height="150"
          />

          {% comment %}
            =============================================================================
            SUBTYPE LABEL
            =============================================================================
            Text label identifying the subtype category
            - block.settings.label: Subtype name from theme editor
            - Displayed below subtype image for clear identification
          {% endcomment %}
          <p>{{ block.settings.label }}</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
{% endif %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  DTC SHOP BY SUBTYPE SECTION SCHEMA - CONFIGURATION & CUSTOMIZATION
  =============================================================================
  Theme editor configuration for DTC subtype navigation
  - name: Section name displayed in theme editor
  - class: CSS class for section styling
  - blocks: Subtype block configuration for merchants
  - presets: Default section configuration with collection category
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    SCHEMA BASIC CONFIGURATION
    =============================================================================
    Core section configuration for theme editor
    - name: Display name in theme editor sidebar
    - class: CSS class for section styling and functionality
  {% endcomment %}
  "name": "DTC Shop By Subtype",
  "class": "dtc-shop-by-subtype",

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    SECTION SETTINGS
    =============================================================================
    No configurable settings for this section
    - Empty array: Section has no merchant-configurable options
    - All customization done through subtype blocks
  {% endcomment %}
  "settings": [

  ],

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    SECTION BLOCKS - SUBTYPE NAVIGATION MANAGEMENT
    =============================================================================
    Subtype block configuration for dynamic navigation
    - Merchants can add multiple subtype blocks
    - Each block represents one subtype navigation option
    - All blocks are displayed in navigation grid
  {% endcomment %}
  "blocks": [
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      SUBTYPE BLOCK TYPE
      =============================================================================
      Individual subtype navigation block
      - name: "Subtype Box": Display name in theme editor
      - type: "subtype": Internal identifier for block type
      - settings: Configurable options for subtype navigation
    {% endcomment %}
    {
      "type": "subtype",
      "name": "Subtype Box",
      "settings": [
        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          SUBTYPE IMAGE SETTING
          =============================================================================
          Subtype category image selection
          - type: "image_picker": Image selector in theme editor
          - id: "image": Internal identifier for Liquid access
          - label: "Image": User-friendly label in theme editor
          - Visual representation of subtype category
        {% endcomment %}
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "Image"
        },

        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          SUBTYPE LABEL SETTING
          =============================================================================
          Text label for subtype category
          - type: "text": Simple text input field
          - id: "label": Internal identifier for Liquid access
          - label: "Label": User-friendly label in theme editor
          - Used for active state detection and accessibility
        {% endcomment %}
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "label",
          "label": "Label"
        },

        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          SUBTYPE LINK SETTING
          =============================================================================
          Navigation destination for subtype
          - type: "url": URL input field with validation
          - id: "link": Internal identifier for Liquid access
          - label: "Link": User-friendly label in theme editor
          - Links to subtype-specific collection or page
        {% endcomment %}
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "link",
          "label": "Link"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    SECTION PRESETS - DEFAULT CONFIGURATION
    =============================================================================
    Default section configuration for easy addition to pages
    - name: "DTC Shop By Subtype": Display name when adding section to page
    - category: "Collection": Groups section with collection-related sections
    - Provides starting point for merchants to customize
    - All blocks start empty by default
  {% endcomment %}
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "DTC Shop By Subtype",
      "category": "Collection"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
